      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how devastatingly final it feels right now, even though your past identity is gone and the people you knew are not coming back. While therapy cannot bring back a life that has ended or erase karma from a past that cannot be compared, it is still the only safe way to get help from trained people who will not turn you into a \"stain\" on the sidewalk. If you are feeling the urge to end it all because you no longer believe there is anything left to live for, please tell a hospital or a crisis line right now so they can help you stay alive.",
