    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting. being a walking reminder of everything people loathe. i'm just tired of pretending there's a point to waking up every morning just to be judged. it feels like i'm just stuck in this waiting room between life and whatever comes next. if the social part of me is already dead... what's actually the difference anymore?",
